    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to No. 25 Beech Lodge, a superb two-bedroom dual-aspect apartment ideally positioned within the prestigious Farmleigh Woods development. This beautifully presented 1st floor apartment offers bright, spacious accommodation and a highly sought-after dual orientation, flooding the interior with natural light throughout the day.\r\nExtending to a generous c.94 square meters and with a well-proportioned layout, the property features a welcoming entrance hall leading to a stylish open-plan living and dining area. Large windows to two aspects create a wonderful sense of space and light, while the private balcony provides the perfect setting for morning coffee or evening relaxation.\r\nThe modern kitchen is fully fitted with ample storage and integrated appliances, seamlessly blending practicality with contemporary design.\r\nThere are two spacious double bedrooms, including a superb primary bedroom complete with a private ensuite bathroom. The second bedroom is equally well-proportioned and serviced by a stylish main bathroom, making this home ideal for owner-occupiers, downsizers, or investors alike.\r\nFarmleigh Wood is a highly regarded, mature development known for its landscaped grounds and peaceful surroundings, only minutes walk from the idyllic Farmleigh House, gardens and cafe, while remaining conveniently close to local amenities including the Phoenix Park, transport links, and excellent shopping facilities.\r\nNo. 25 Beech Lodge presents a wonderful opportunity to acquire a turnkey home in one of Castleknocks most desirable developments."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall:\t with solid oak wood floor, recessed lighting, intercom, hotpress and storage closet \r\n\r\nLounge:  with granite feature fireplace and gas fire, solid oak wood floor, TV point and doors to dual aspect balcony \r\n8.1x5.0m\t     \t\r\n\t\r\nKitchen:  modern fitted kitchen with wall and floor mounted units, granite worktop,  tiled floor, recessed lighting, breakfast bar with glass top, integrated oven, hob and microwave, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:  with floor to ceiling built in wardrobes, recessed lighting, solid oak wood floor, TV point and patio door to dual aspect balcony \r\n5.4x3.3m\t\r\n\r\nEnsuite:  with walk in shower, W.C and W.H.B, fully tiled walls and tiled floor  \r\n\r\nBedroom 2:  with built in wardrobes, recessed lighting, solid oak wood floor and TV point \r\n4.0x3.3m\t\r\n\r\nBathroom: with W.C and W.H.B and bath, recessed lighting, fully tiled walls and  tiled floor"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Outside\r\nLarge south westerly facing rear balcony with timber decking overlooking large mature green \r\nFront balcony area on corner with dual aspect  \r\nTwo underground car-parking spaces with security gates \r\nAllocated lock up storage unit in secure underground car-park\r\n\r\n\r\nServices\r\nGFCH\r\nHardwood double glazed windows  \r\nIntercom system\r\n\r\n\r\nLocal Area Information\r\nPublic transport routes that service Castleknock:\r\nBus: 37 and 38 and Rail: Castleknock Rail Station \r\nNearby Areas: Strawberry Beds, Porterstown, Carpenterstown, Phoenix Park and Blanchardstown Shopping Centre"
      },
      {
